\"→compact \"atleticomg\" in ALIASES → atleticomineiro ✓. \"Atlético - PR\" → \"atleticopr\" in ALIASES → atleticoparanaense ✓. \"Atlético - GO\" → \"atleticogo\" → atleticogoianiense ✓. \"Atletico - ES\" (Copa) → \"atleticoes\" (Atlético-ES? There was a \"Atlético\" in ES? tiny club, fine). \n\n- \"America - MG\" → \"americamg\" → ALIASES → americamineiro ✓. \"America - RN\" → \"americarn\" → key. \"America RN\" (BR-Football space) → compact \"americarn\" → ALIASES ✓ (add it). \"Americano RJ\" → compact \"americanorj\" → base \"americano\" unclaimed+\"RJ\"... \"Americano - RJ\" → strip → \"americano\" + state rj → \"americanorj\" — both variants → same key ✓ (merge happens naturally!). NICE: suffixed-key rule merges \"X - ST\" and \"X ST\" forms automatically.\n\nSo ALIASES needs entries for: major clubs' state-suffixed compact forms (atléticomg, flamengorj, gremiors, saopaulosp, ...) + FIFA full names (sportclubcorinthianspaulista, sportclubdorecife, cearasportingclub, americafcminasgerais, atléticomineiro (bare full name — that IS the canonical compact... so CLUBS[\"atléticomineiro\".compact] = \"atleticomineiro\" self) + foreign country-coded compact forms + spelling unifiers (athletico variants).\n\nLet me now enumerate ALIASES concretely. Canonical club keys and displays (major Brazilian clubs):\n\nkey → (display, state):\n- flamengo (Flamengo, RJ); fluminense (Fluminense, RJ); botafogo (Botafogo, RJ); vascodagama (Vasco da Gama, RJ)\n- corinthians (Corinthians, SP); palmeiras (Palmeiras, SP); saopaulo (São Paulo, SP); santos (Santos, SP); pontepreta (Ponte Preta, SP); portuguesa (Portuguesa, SP); guarani (Guarani, SP); saocaetano (São Caetano, SP); redbullbragantino (Red Bull Bragantino, SP); bragantino → alias to redbullbragantino? \"Bragantino\" (novo 2019? let me check if novo has \"RB Bragantino\"... earlier novo team list: [... 'Barueri', 'Botafogo-RJ', 'Brasiliense', ...] — no Bragantino in novo teams list?? Wait the list: 'América-MG','América-RN','Ath