s, minor. NO WAIT — ugh. OK here's a tiebreaker thought: does \"Vitória\" (BA) Copa appearances exist in the CUP FILE 2016-2021? cup file uses \"Vitória - BA\" ✓ observed. So the CUP FILE (chosen for 2012-2021) uses the correct \"Vitória - BA\" → canonical vitoria ✓. brf Copa \"Vitoria EC\" rows only matter for 2022-2023 Copa (brf-chosen): \"Vitoria EC\" Copa 2022 = 3, 2023 = 0. Copa 2022: did Vitória-BA play? YES (Serie B 2021 → Copa 2022 R3). So brf's 2022 \"Vitoria EC\" = Vitória-BA! → ALIAS vitoriaec→vitoria ✓ DECIDED (matches Copa 2022 where it matters).\n  \"vitoriaes\": \"vitoriaes\",   # self — unknown small ES club (if exists), keep distinct\n  \n  # FIFA full names\n  \"sportclubcorinthianspaulista\": \"corinthians\",\n  \"sportclubdorecife\": \"sportrecife\",\n  \"cearasportingclub\": \"ceara\",\n  \"americafcminasgerais\": \"americamineiro\",\n  \"novorizontino\": \"gremionovorizontino\",\n  \n  # Athletico Paranaense spellings\n  \"athletico\": \"atleticoparanaense\",\n  \"athleticopr\": \"atleticoparanaense\",\n  \"athleticoparanaense\": \"atleticoparanaense\",\n  \"athleticoparanaensepr\": \"atleticoparanaense\",\n  \"atleticopr\": \"atleticoparanaense\",\n  \"atleticoparanaensepr\": \"atleticoparanaense\",\n  \n  # Atlético MG/GO with suffix\n  \"atleticomg\": \"atleticomineiro\",\n  \"atleticogo\": \"atleticogoianiense\",\n  \"atleticogoianiense\"?? not observed; skip\n  \n  # América MG\n  \"americamg\": \"americamineiro\",\n  \"americarn\": \"americarn\",     # self — América-RN distinct club ✓ (canonical? make it a CLUB: americarn display \"América-RN\" RN)\n  \n  # CRB / CSA letter-dotted forms\n  \"crbal\": \"crb\",\n  \"csaal\": \"csa\",\n  \n  # Libertadores country-coded foreign clubs (keep distinct)\n  \"nacionaluru\": \"nacionaluru\",\n  \"nacionalpar\": \"nacionalpar\",\n  \"guaranipar\": \"guaranipar\",\n  \"barcelonaequ\": \"barcelonaequ\",\n  \"delfinequ\": \"delfinequ\",\n  \"riverplateuru\": \"riverplateuru\",\n  \"olimpiapar\": \"ol