dings(data, \"brasileirao\", 2023)\nprint(\"2023 champ:\", t23.champion.team, t23.champion.points, \"| notes:\", n23)\nprint(\"2023 relegated:\", [r.team for r in t23.relegated])\nEOF","workdir":"/Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-7ooj92cj/retort-9b01b8399d96"},"output":"2020 relegated: [(17, 'Vasco da Gama', 41), (18, 'Goiás', 37), (19, 'Coritiba', 31), (20, 'Botafogo', 27)]\n2020 notes: []\nCorinthians 2022 bra home: 19 12 4 3 24 11\nLib finals: [(2013, None, 2), (2014, 'San Lorenzo', 2), (2015, 'River Plate', 2), (2016, 'Atlético Nacional', 2), (2017, 'Grêmio', 2), (2018, 'River Plate', 2), (2019, 'Flamengo', 1), (2020, 'Palmeiras', 1)]\nCopa finals: [(2013, 'Flamengo'), (2014, 'Atlético Mineiro'), (2015, None), (2017, None), (2018, 'Cruzeiro'), (2019, 'Athletico Paranaense'), (2020, 'Palmeiras'), (2022, None), (2023, 'São Paulo')]\nPalmeiras comps: ['brasileirao', 'libertadores', 'copadobrasil']\nFla-Flu: 44 18 14 12\nbiggest margins: [(8, 'River Plate 8-0 Jorge Wilstermann'), (8, 'River Plate 8-0 Binacional'), (8, 'São Paulo 9-1 4 de Julho - PI'), (7, 'Goiás 7-0 Juventude'), (7, 'Bahia 0-7 Cruzeiro')]\n2018 champ: Palmeiras 80\n2018 relegated: ['Sport Recife', 'América Mineiro', 'Vitória', 'Paraná']\n2023 derbies: [('Fla-Flu', 4), ('Clássico dos Milhões', 2), ('Clássico Vovô', 2), ('Clássico da Amizade', 2), ('Majestoso', 4), ('Choque-Rei', 4), ('Derby Paulista', 2), ('San-São', 2), ('Grenal', 2), ('Clássico Mineiro', 2), ('Atletiba', 2), ('Re-Pa', 1)]\n2023 champ: Grêmio 68 | notes: ['The dataset is incomplete for this season (377 of 380 matches), so the table is provisional.']\n2023 relegated: ['Vasco da Gama', 'Goiás', 'Coritiba', 'América Mineiro']\n","metadata":{"output":"2020 relegated: [(17, 'Vasco da Gama', 41), (18, 'Goiás', 37), (19, 'Coritiba', 31), (20, 'Botafogo', 27)]\n2020 notes: []\nCorinthians 2022 bra home: 19 12 4 3 24 11\nLib finals: [(2013, None, 2), (2014, 'San Lorenzo', 2), (2015, 'River Plate', 2), (2016, 'Atlético Nacional', 2), (201