a yields (Grêmio with provisional note) or use 2019 Flamengo instead for champion tests. I'll test 2019 (complete) and note 2023 provisional.\n\n- Fla-Flu 44 matches: 18W-14W-12D ✓ sums to 44 ✓.\n\nLet me check the 2012 Copa rounds quickly, then write the tests.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05c5ecf4b001Di5CVpDoIGA6di","sessionID":"ses_fa3ba9cb2ffeFGH9rzdcVMfYFE","messageID":"msg_05c5eb76b001fUhTihOCPlbO7y"}}
