quest should explain that cups have no standings\n\n  Scenario: What competitions has Palmeiras played in\n    Given the match data is loaded\n    When I request the competitions of team \"Palmeiras\"\n    Then the answer should include \"Brasileirão\", \"Copa do Brasil\" and \"Libertadores\"\n\n  Scenario: Listing all competitions shows coverage\n    Given the match data is loaded\n    When I list all competitions\n    Then all five competitions should be listed\n    And each competition should list its season coverage\n","filePath":"/Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-7ooj92cj/retort-9b01b8399d96/tests/features/competition_queries.feature"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-7ooj92cj/retort-9b01b8399d96/tests/features/competition_queries.feature","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"tests/features/competition_queries.feature","time":{"start":1788256171771,"end":1788256171780}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_05c5fadfc001RTyMvo4Z781TxR","sessionID":"ses_fa3ba9cb2ffeFGH9rzdcVMfYFE","messageID":"msg_05c5fa688001MwZk8ZBqQtBIXU"}}
